# Purpose
Explain, in public-safe language, how a reader can play a game or answer a
picker inside Agent IQ while the agent keeps working, and how an agent runs
that loop with plain MCP calls (no steering prompt), identically for Claude and
Codex.

# Dependencies
- build-agent-iq-metal-layouts.md for frame design and script-region basics.
- ../CATALOGUE.md routes users and agents here.
- ../SANITIZATION.md supplies the publication boundary.

# Gotchas
- Only the documented contract is public: window.gvIq.emit, the
  konui_agent_iq_get fields inputsAfter/waitForInputMs and the inputs result.
  Never name private endpoints, storage paths or internal message types.
- The example is illustrative; it is not live telemetry.
- Durable gvturn cards are a different surface: their inline scripts start a
  new turn and cannot feed this loop.

# Change History
- 2026-09-28: Created with the player-input lane.
